# The sidecar is built, never committed: it is the `nysia` binary for one target triple,
# staged here by `pnpm sidecar` (scripts/sidecar.ts) before the app is bundled. An ordinary
# `cargo build` neither needs nor reads it — the sidecar is declared in
# tauri.bundle.conf.json, which only the bundler merges.
*
!.gitignore
